# The builder image only needs the tape sources. Everything else in the Duct
# tree -- the distro rootfs tarball especially -- would just bloat the context
# and invalidate the build cache on unrelated changes.
#
# BuildKit prefers this file over a .dockerignore at the context root, which is
# what keeps the Duct root free of Docker bookkeeping.

*
!tape/

tape/bin/
tape/dev/tmp/
tape/tmp/

**/.git/
**/.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
